22 15.42 11.57 15.65C10.93 15.88 10.23 16 9.5 16ZM9.5 14C10.75 14 11.81 13.56 12.69 12.69C13.56 11.81 14 10.75 14 9.5C14 8.25 13.56 7.19 12.69 6.31C11.81 5.44 10.75 5 9.5 5C8.25 5 7.19 5.44 6.31 6.31C5.44 7.19 5 8.25 5 9.5C5 10.75 5.44 11.81 6.31 12.69C7.19 13.56 8.25 14 9.5 14Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </svg></div></div></button></div><!----></div></div></div></div></div><div class="faqs__inner" data-v-b67004cf><section class="faqs__wrapper" data-v-b67004cf><div class="faqs__content" data-v-b67004cf><div class="faqs__inner-slices" data-v-b67004cf><div data-v-b67004cf><!--[--><section id="i-can’t-add-a-parcel-to-my-basket" class="section-wrapper rich-text" index="0" data-v-92714c58 data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><!--[--><h1><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->I can’t add a parcel to my basket<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--></h1><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->If you’re experiencing some difficulties with adding parcels to your basket, there could be a few reasons this is happening. Don’t worry, you’re in the right place, and we’re here to help.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Try these quick steps before we dive in:<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><ul><!--[--><!--[--><li><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Double-check the parcel details you’ve entered, like the size, weight, and address, to make sure everything’s correct and complete.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Try refreshing the page or logging out and back into your account to see if that helps reset things.  <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><!--]--><!--]--></ul><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->If the problem persists, please click the link below to submit a response to our survey on Google Forms for our team to investigate. <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><a href="https://forms.gle/kAHqUixszNzfoGUMA" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Click here to quickly report your basket issue<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Please note, this Google Form is to report basket-related issues only and should take less than 5 minutes to complete. <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->For queries about transactions, make sure you have your tracking number, ParcelShop receipt number or calling card number before contacting our <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/contact-us" rel="noreferrer" target="_self"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->customer services<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> team. <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--><!--]--></div></section><!--]--></div></div></div><div class="faqs-right-coumn" data-v-b67004cf><div class="faqs-additional-help" data-v-b67004cf data-v-90f8fa03><h5 data-v-90f8fa03>Additional help</h5><!--[--><a href="/i-cant-make-a-payment" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-v-90f8fa03>Struggling to make a payment?</a><a href="/account/is-there-a-problem-with-the-website" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-v-90f8fa03>Is there a problem with the website?</a><!--]--></div></div></section><div class="faqs-accordion__container" data-v-b67004cf data-v-538ce356><section class="faqs-accordion" data-v-538ce356><!--[--><div class="e-accordion-row" data-test-id="faq-links-accordion-row-0" data-v-538ce356 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-faq-links-0" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-faq-links-0" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-test-id="faq-links-accordion-row-0-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class=